      "postDate": "2026-09-25T19:50:07.790Z",
      "rawMarkdown": "Could you please tell how you managed to get the dataset into colab? I have colab pro+ subscription, but for almost a month now, I have not been able to use it because I simply do not have enough disk space on colab. I got the data into my google drive but reading from drive during training is EXTREMELY SLOW.",
